<title>SINGAPORE: SingTel raises share capital in unit.</title>
<headline>SingTel raises share capital in unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>State telephone company Singapore Telecommunications Ltd (SingTel) said on Thursday its wholly-owned unit SingTelSat Pte Ltd had raised its issued and paid up share capital to Singapore $76 million from S$2.</p>
<p>SingTel said in a statement the unit had raised the capital by issuing 76 million ordinary shares to SingTel at S$1 each.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for the change.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
